                    </span>
                    <!-- 内容 -->
                    <div class="scroll-container" style="position: relative;left:0;height:40%; overflow: hidden;">
                        <div id="scrollContent" class="scroll-content">
                                <span id="download" class="paragraph_1">
                                    <p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;font-size: 24px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">徐州市</span><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">202</span></span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;font-size: 24px">6</span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;font-size: 24px">年事业单位统一公开招聘人员（含定向招聘退役大学生士兵）网报专题</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋简体;font-size: 21px">***网报入口在本网页最下边***</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋简体;font-size:21px">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin-left:28px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color: #FF0000;font-size: 21px">1.</span><a href="https://hrss.xz.gov.cn/001/001004/20260320/9545437c-677a-4dac-bcc9-476e7e0773d1.html"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">徐州市</span>202</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年事业单位</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">统一</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">公开招聘人员</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">公告</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（含</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">岗</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">位表）</span></span></strong></a></p><p style="margin-left: 28px"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px">2.</span></strong><a href="https://hrss.xz.gov.cn/001/001004/20260320/c952a782-3d54-4e81-b4f0-00e56af0cacf.html"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">徐州市</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2025</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">事业单位定向招聘退役大学生士兵</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">公告</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（含职位表）</span></span></strong></a></p><p style="margin-left: 28px"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">报名网址</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">：</span></span></strong><a href="https://hrss.xz.gov.cn/rsks"><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color: #FF0000;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">徐州人事考试网</span></span></span></strong></a></p><p style="text-indent:37px;text-align:center"><strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:19px">&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">友情提醒</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（一）</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">注册密码区分大小写，报考人员在设置密码时，请设置为便于记忆并确保安全的密码，不要记混淆。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（二）</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">考生在全</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">范围内只能选择一个职位报考，</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考人员填报信息时应谨慎准确，请勿进行所谓的</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">尝试</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名，如报考人员输入的报名信息符合所选职位报考条件并通过资格初审，将不得更改职位或修改信息，误报或录入错误后果自负。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（三）</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考人员上传的电子照片如不符合要求，可通过</span>PHOTOSHOP<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">等图像处理软件改变图像格式及大小。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（四）</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">建议有条件的报考人员将网上报名提交信息的时间安排在午夜或凌晨，以避开网络使用的高峰期。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（五）</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">网络报名采用的是</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">线上缴费模式</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">，请报考人员务必在网上支付以后，</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">及时查看缴费状态，是否为缴费成功</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（六）</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名期间请密切关注</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名网站</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">，有关考试信息都将通过网站公布。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">报名咨询</span></p><p style="margin-top: 5px;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 5px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考者对招录职位的专业、学历、学位、技能、证书等资格条件有疑问需要咨询时，可直接与招录机关联系。</span></span></p><table cellspacing="0" width="643" align="center"><tbody><tr style="height:36px" class="firstRow"><td width="643" valign="center" nowrap="" colspan="4" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;"><p style=";text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;font-size: 27px">招聘主管部门网址和联系电话</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:27px"><td width="45" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16px">序号</span></p></td><td width="258" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16px">招聘主管部门</span></p></td><td width="241" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:黑体">网</span> &nbsp;<span style="font-family:黑体">址</span></span></p></td><td width="99" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0